// A directory named guide.bin or oversee.bin is not the cube.
// The read ignores it. An empty directory is removed on write.
// A directory that still holds a name stays.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE cubedir ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG cubedir law

IMPULSE cubedir 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "cubedir" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
